{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271860/extras/castlekillrunbigger.gif?t=1741291350\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hand-drawn 2D metroidvania focused on fast movement, double and triple jumps, and the freedom to climb any vertical surface, including enemies to punch them in the face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey to punch people I hate, those responsible for the hellscape we live in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect coins, increase your stats, and  combine elemental upgrades to become unstoppable as your freeze, burn, poison, and electrocute your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271860/extras/murdoch.gif?t=1741291350\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Game Features</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic side-scrolling action, with modern trimmings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tight, responsible 2D controls. Dodge, jump, climb, slide, and punch your way through a multitude of different enemies and traps!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Double, triple, and quadruple jump as you increase your jump stamina!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover your own path! Explore the world for secrets that contain more bosses and extra upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evolve and become powerful with elemental upgrades to your punch, that you can both upgrade and combine together. Freeze, poison, and strike your enemies with lightning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect coins that explode from their bodies to upgrade your stats. Punch harder, burn hotter, shield stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A massive cast of enemies and bosses, brought to life with traditional 2D frame by frame animation.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271860/extras/exit.gif?t=1741291350\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3271860?t=1741291350","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741291350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271860/d3641c1e09d787706ba3853849cbf2791535913f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741291350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271860/d3641c1e09d787706ba3853849cbf2791535913f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741291350","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3403840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271860/extras/castlekillrunbigger.gif?t=1741291350\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hand-drawn 2D metroidvania focused on fast movement, double and triple jumps, and the freedom to climb any vertical surface, including enemies to punch them in the face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey to punch people I hate, those responsible for the hellscape we live in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect coins, increase your stats, and  combine elemental upgrades to become unstoppable as your freeze, burn, poison, and electrocute your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271860/extras/murdoch.gif?t=1741291350\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Game Features</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic side-scrolling action, with modern trimmings.</p